# Threat Intelligence Investigations

Threat-intelligence investigations from [CyberDefenders](https://cyberdefenders.org/), each documented as a SOC-style report: how a single IOC is pivoted across intel platforms to classify the threat, extract IOCs and C2 infrastructure, and map behaviour to MITRE ATT&CK. The focus is the analytical pivot chain, not just the answers.

**Core skills:** IOC pivoting, malware classification, C2 identification, sandbox behavioural analysis, YARA, MITRE ATT&CK mapping.

**Tools:** VirusTotal, MalwareBazaar, ThreatFox, Malpedia, ANY.RUN, Triage, Whois.

